sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as API Client
    participant Controller as Spring Controller
    participant Service as Business Logic
    participant Repo as JPA Repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Client->>Controller: HTTP Request
    Note over Controller: Validate Input
    
    Controller->>Service: Process Request
    Note over Service: Business Logic<br/>(Validation, Calculations)
    
    Service->>Repo: Query/Save Data
    Note over Repo: Hibernate ORM<br/>(Translate to SQL)
    
    Repo->>DB: SQL Query
    Note over DB: Execute on Database
    
    DB-->>Repo: Result Set
    Repo-->>Service: Entity Object
    Service-->>Controller: Response Object
    
    alt Exception Occurred
        Controller->>Controller: GlobalExceptionHandler
        Controller-->>Client: Error JSON (400/404/500)
    else Success
        Controller-->>Client: Success JSON (200/201)
    end
